{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">形狀獨特、猶如縮小版南瓜的太空茄外形討喜。在節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽示範了一道造型精緻的「味噌肉碎煮太空茄」，將材料一層一層疊起，賣相極佳。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"56fe4128-bede-4dbd-aa56-a50a5046df20.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026jw12M4Rmrx1784791601.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"56fe4128-bede-4dbd-aa56-a50a5046df20.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>味噌肉碎煮太空茄食譜</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>做法步驟</strong>：</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"69ff3405-0cb0-4835-a769-cab4d3a44c3e.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026AylhGFgMo81784791590.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"69ff3405-0cb0-4835-a769-cab4d3a44c3e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>烹調貼士</strong>：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T09:18:22.395724+00:00